<h2>Comparison: Old vs New Approach</h2>

<table>
<tr><th>Aspect</th><th>Old Guide (Chapter 5)</th><th>New Approach (v10)</th></tr>
<tr><td>Generate library</td><td><code>ng generate library</code></td><td>Copy files from <code>rmb</code> project</td></tr>
<tr><td>Linting</td><td><code>tslint.json</code></td><td><code>.eslintrc.json</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Dynamic loading config</td><td><code>ng-package.dynamic.json</code> + "dynamic" config in angular.json</td><td>Case statement in <code>portal-dynamic-modules-import.service.ts</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Project config</td><td><code>imx-project.json</code></td><td><code>project.json</code> (Nx schema)</td></tr>
<tr><td>tsconfig.lib.prod.json</td><td>Remove <code>compilationMode: partial</code>, add <code>enableIvy: true</code></td><td>Just <code>declarationMap: false</code> (Ivy is default)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Entry file</td><td>Rename <code>public-api.ts</code> =E2=86=92 <code>public_api.ts</code></td><td>Create as <code>public_api.ts</code> directly</td></tr>
<tr><td>IIS Deployment</td><td>Create <code>Html_&lt;plugin-name&gt;</code> folder, copy <code>imx-plugin-config.json</code></td><td>Plugin bundled into app =E2=80=94 just deploy <code>dist/qer-app-portal/</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Tile component</td><td><code>&lt;imx-tile&gt;</code> with <code>size=3D"Addon-Tile"</code></td><td><code>&lt;imx-badge-tile&gt;</code> from <code>TilesModule</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Template syntax</td><td><code>*ngIf</code></td><td><code>@if (condition) { }</code></td></tr>
<tr><td>Component metadata</td><td><code>template: '...'</code> inline</td><td><code>templateUrl</code> + <code>standalone: false</code></td></tr>
</table>

